    "caption": "Inspect 36 exact source-label interfaces with native T1/T2, 21 complete provided source-label boundaries and 108 source-grid schematic sections. All 652 shared source-cell faces are retained, including 23 faces between four opposite-side-named pairs. These source correspondences do not establish biological walls, fibre continuity, complete reporting anatomy or diagnostic suitability.",
    "attribution": "SPL-PNL/NAC Brain Atlas: Michael Halle, Florin Talos, Marianna Jakab, Nikos Makris, Dominic Meier, Laurence Wald, Bruce Fischl, Ron Kikinis and collaborators. Source commit bec24db25aad5f7600e2df3becfb1f883e61ff56. Original native MRI and categorical label samples are retained. Primer\u2019s marked adaptation derives exact label-cell boundaries and adds grouped native-image relationship controls, preserving source components without fitted registration or cleanup. Full original source notices and licensing terms accompany the reference. Additional marked adaptation, 2026-11-01: 94 additional named source classes, original publisher-surface and exact source-cell representations. Original surface positions, components and strip triangles are retained; no mesh cleanup or fitted registration is applied. Marked adaptation: categorical shared-face interface models and original-grid section schematics. Transparent context preserves all source-label components; no source sample or geometry is fitted, repaired or smoothed by Primer.",
